5. IF YOU WANT TO REUSE THIS PROJECT
------------------------------------

You are welcome to reuse the code. To do so cleanly:

  * delete the contents of assets/ and the root favicon.ico, and replace them
    with imagery of your own
  * replace the editorial content under content/ and the strings in
    src/_data/ui.json with your own
  * remove the Federation name, logo and wordmark from the templates, and do
    not present your site as being that of the Federation

Requests for permission to use any excluded material: it@polsocfederation.pl
